Just now, right before Kurumi called out to him, he was about to say something, wasn't he?

255
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:06,860
What are you two doing? I want in!

256
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:10,380
We were just...

257
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,340
We weren't really doing anything.

258
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:21,460
What do you mean? You're funny.

259
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:28,780
I see. It was in my head. There was nothing going on.

260
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:36,160
Of course, right? I must be overthinking things. I'm being silly.

261
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,780
It's hot in here.

262
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:46,960
When it comes to Kazuhaya, I'm just too hypersensitive.

263
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:50,260
Oh, Sawako, you're sweating like crazy.

264
00:19:50,580 --> 00:19:53,080
I'm suddenly nervous.

265
00:19:53,080 --> 00:20:14,780
She really is a nice person.

266
00:20:14,780 --> 00:20:16,900
Uh, thank you.

267
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:17,740
Mm-mm.

268
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:20,420
There. All good.

269
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:25,940
I think... I may have become her fan just now.

270
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:29,880
Huh. I had no idea they became so close.

271
00:20:31,580 --> 00:20:33,660
Oh, that's right. Was there something you needed?

272
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:37,940
Mm-mm. Not really. I just came over to talk to Sawako.

273
00:20:37,940 --> 00:20:39,440
Definitely a fan.

274
00:20:39,780 --> 00:20:42,300
Since the two of us have become friends, after all.

275
00:20:42,560 --> 00:20:43,600
Right, Sawako?

276
00:20:44,180 --> 00:20:45,560
Mm-hmm. I'm your fan...

277
00:20:45,560 --> 00:20:47,940
FRIEN...

278
00:20:47,940 --> 00:20:55,100
Yeah, we're friends.

279
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:57,280
I mean, obviously, right?

280
00:20:57,280 --> 00:21:04,280
Friends...

281
00:21:12,820 --> 00:21:14,080
Friends?

282
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:15,200
That's it.

283
00:21:44,080 --> 00:22:14,060
Thank you.

284
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:34,740
A frustrating atmosphere. An awkward exchange of words. Next time, working together.

285
00:22:44,080 --> 00:23:14,060
Thank you.

